sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant B as Browser
  participant N as Next.js (/api/devices)
  participant R as Relay
  participant D as Fabric desktop
  B->>N: POST /api/devices/register {type: browser}
  N-->>B: {deviceId, token} (held in memory only)
  B->>N: GET /api/devices
  N-->>B: computers with live flag
  B->>R: relay-client-hello {token, targetDeviceId}
  R->>N: POST /api/devices/validate
  N-->>R: {userId}
  R-->>B: relay-hello-ok
  B->>R: session-list
  R->>D: session-list
  D-->>B: session-list-result (recent repos + chats)
  B->>R: session-create {projectPath}
  R->>D: session-create
  D-->>B: session-create-result {SessionInfo}
  B->>D: attach {chatId}
  D-->>B: attach-snapshot
  B->>D: prompt {prompt, permissionMode}
  loop agent turn
    D-->>B: session-event delta / tool-call / tool-result
    opt tool needs approval
      D-->>B: session-event permission-request
      B->>D: permission-response {approved}
    end
  end
  D-->>B: session-event turn-end
